WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:21.720
I’m so very happy
that there are so many people

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:27.720
that are interested in Sahaja Yoga
in Madras.

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:35.360
I’ve been coming here quite often
and I felt that if people from Madras

00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:41.720
once understand Sahaja Yoga,
they will realise that all these years,

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:47.040
whatever they have been seeking,
whatever they have been doing,

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:51.560
in the name of God,
in the name of religion,

00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:57.680
now is the time for them
to get the results.

00:23:57.680 --> 00:24:02.320
The people in Madras,
I know, are very religious.

00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:12.320
But they are religious in a way
that’s just, as Adi Shankaracharya

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:20.320
has said it, "Chapta jalam".
That we are lost in "chapta jalam":

00:24:20.320 --> 00:24:26.800
we say mantras, we read books,
there are Shaivites

00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:31.720
and also there are people
who are Vaishnavites.

00:24:31.720 --> 00:24:38.000
All these things to us
have been important also,

00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:42.160
because we thought
by following these methods,

00:24:42.160 --> 00:24:47.320
we will achieve our moksha,
we’ll achieve our last goal.

00:24:47.320 --> 00:24:51.400
This way I must say
that Indians are very alert

00:24:51.400 --> 00:24:54.560
and they are basically
spiritually minded.

00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:57.760
They also know what is wrong
and what is good.

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:01.800
They also know what is dharma,
what is not dharma.

00:25:01.800 --> 00:25:06.840
They may do wrong things.
They may take to things

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:13.840
which are absolutely
against their spiritual life.

00:25:13.840 --> 00:25:20.440
But in their heart of hearts,
they all know that this is wrong.

00:25:20.440 --> 00:25:24.080
But they can’t help it.

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:27.680
Now we have to understand
that we are specially blessed.

00:25:33.360 --> 00:25:41.040
We are specially blessed
by people who were our forefathers,

00:25:41.040 --> 00:25:45.840
we can say, who were our people
in this ancient country,

00:25:45.840 --> 00:25:51.280
who were great seers,
great saints and incarnations,

00:25:51.280 --> 00:26:00.880
and who have given so much time
for the emancipation of our spiritual life.

00:26:00.880 --> 00:26:07.320
To them, material life
was not so important.

00:26:07.320 --> 00:26:17.360
Specially in the South, I feel that people
are deeply rooted into dharma.

00:26:17.360 --> 00:26:25.880
I read about Shalivahana
who met once Christ,

00:26:25.880 --> 00:26:30.200
one of the Shalivahanas in Kashmir.

00:26:30.200 --> 00:26:39.808
And Christ told him that,
"I come from the country of Mlecchas,

00:26:39.808 --> 00:26:39.855
mlec, mala-iccha.
The iccha is desire for filth.

00:26:39.855 --> 00:26:39.905
Their desire is towards matter,
not towards purity.

00:26:39.905 --> 00:26:39.973
And I have come here because you people
are absolutely nirmal, pure."

00:26:39.973 --> 00:26:40.023
Shalivahan told him,
"Why do you want to come here?

00:26:40.023 --> 00:26:40.081
You should go and work
for those people who are malekshas."

00:26:40.081 --> 00:26:40.123
We are different type of people
even today.

00:26:40.123 --> 00:26:40.177
Even in this ghor Kali Yuga,
at least 70 percent people

00:26:40.177 --> 00:26:40.219
believe in God,
have faith and fear of God.

00:26:40.219 --> 00:26:40.269
All this that we have
is nothing but a kind of awe.

00:26:40.269 --> 00:26:40.291
A fear of the unknown.

00:26:40.291 --> 00:26:40.360
We don’t know that God Almighty
is the ocean of compassion and love.

00:26:40.360 --> 00:26:44.200
Now we are as human beings.

00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:48.760
We have to achieve a state
to know Him.

00:26:48.760 --> 00:26:52.560
We don’t know God.
We don’t know ourselves.

00:26:52.560 --> 00:26:55.840
First, we have to know ourselves.

00:26:55.840 --> 00:27:02.080
Once we know ourselves,
then only we will know God.

00:27:02.080 --> 00:27:07.040
I have seen ritualistic behaviour
in the South very much,

00:27:07.040 --> 00:27:10.800
especially in Madras
when I came first time.

00:27:10.800 --> 00:27:15.720
I was surprised how people
were doing everything with their heart,

00:27:15.720 --> 00:27:20.600
but they did not know
why they were doing it.

00:27:20.600 --> 00:27:24.840
They had such bhakti,
but such a blind bhakti,

00:27:24.840 --> 00:27:28.000
that it will lead them nowhere!

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:34.920
I used to think that, "When will I be able
to tell them to be beyond this?"

00:27:34.920 --> 00:27:40.560
You have to have shraddha,
and shraddha is enlightened bhakti.

00:27:40.560 --> 00:27:45.720
Unless and until you have your
enlightenment, the bhakti has no meaning.

00:27:45.720 --> 00:27:50.680
Like this, if it is not connected
to the mains, it has no meaning.

00:27:50.680 --> 00:27:54.280
Unless and until you connect it
to this All-pervading Power

00:27:54.280 --> 00:27:57.520
of Divine love,
which we call as Brahma Chaitanya,

00:27:58.040 --> 00:28:01.360
our bhakti has no meaning
because there is no connection,

00:28:01.360 --> 00:28:05.240
like telephoning to someone
without the connection.

00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:09.960
So, simple thing is: this connection,
this Yoga, has to take place.

00:28:09.960 --> 00:28:11.637
You might have read lots of books
or may know so many things like Vedas.

00:28:11.637 --> 00:28:12.111
So what?
It’s like you have a headache

00:28:12.111 --> 00:28:14.280
and the doctor suggests a medicine.
He writes the name of the medicine.

00:28:14.280 --> 00:28:19.320
You are not taking the medicine,
just reading the name of the medicine.

00:28:19.320 --> 00:28:22.560
"This is the medicine I have to take.
This is the medicine I have to take."

00:28:22.560 --> 00:28:26.520
When are you going to take it?

00:28:26.520 --> 00:28:29.920
And unless and until
you take that medicine,

00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:34.280
you are not going to achieve,
by any chance,

00:28:34.280 --> 00:28:37.560
whatever is promised to you.

00:28:37.560 --> 00:28:46.640
Because it is such a deep ignorance
about all these ideas we have learnt,

00:28:46.640 --> 00:28:51.120
and that has penetrated into us.
Such a lot of ignorance!

00:28:51.120 --> 00:28:59.440
That ignorance, really,
is like a ditch of no return.

00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:04.120
I have seen people,
they have books after books.

00:29:04.120 --> 00:29:07.120
There are people who will do,
I don’t know,

00:29:07.120 --> 00:29:12.960
one lakh of mantras, Shiva’s mantras.
Somebody will do this.

00:29:12.960 --> 00:29:17.880
Somebody will do that,
then fasting, this, that,

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:20.751
and reach nowhere.

00:29:20.751 --> 00:29:29.440
They are the most hot-tempered people,
or they have no joy in their heart.

00:29:29.440 --> 00:29:34.240
They leave their families,
come out of it,

00:29:34.240 --> 00:29:38.640
and they think that they have done
a great sacrifice.

00:29:38.640 --> 00:29:42.400
God does not want all this nonsense.
He doesn’t want.

00:29:42.400 --> 00:29:46.640
Why will God, who is your Father,
who is so compassionate

00:29:46.640 --> 00:29:52.160
and loving personality,
supposing you call Him that way,

00:29:52.160 --> 00:29:57.320
then why will a father want you to suffer?

00:29:58.280 --> 00:30:05.520
And all kinds of funny ideas of suffering
have penetrated within us.

00:30:05.520 --> 00:30:11.760
We can always say about the people
who are, say, Muslims,

00:30:11.760 --> 00:30:19.760
or even the Christians,
they believe in all kinds of penances.

00:30:19.760 --> 00:30:21.920
From where these ideas
are coming to their heads?

00:30:21.920 --> 00:30:27.240
That also I don’t know.
Because why should you suffer?

00:30:29.640 --> 00:30:37.640
By suffering,
how will you gain moksha?

00:30:37.640 --> 00:30:40.840
It’s beyond Me.

00:30:40.840 --> 00:30:45.960
If you take it the other way round,
as Kabira has said it,

00:30:46.560 --> 00:30:52.480
"By starving, if you are going
to achieve your moksha,

00:30:52.480 --> 00:30:56.600
then already there are many people
who are starving in this country.

00:30:56.600 --> 00:31:01.280
So they will all get their mokshas."

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:07.315
He says, "By shaving your head,
if you are going to get moksha,

00:31:07.315 --> 00:31:13.720
then the sheep which is shaved every year
should be there before you are there."

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:15.760
They all have made fun of you.

00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:21.040
They have all said all kinds of things
for you to know

00:31:21.040 --> 00:31:27.520
that all these outside things
are of no help.

00:31:27.520 --> 00:31:35.400
Of course, you do it genuinely.
You are attempting everything genuinely,

00:31:35.400 --> 00:31:40.560
because you want to have your liberation,
your enlightenment.

00:31:40.560 --> 00:31:43.280
But as a Mother, I tell you,
you don’t have to do all this,

00:31:43.280 --> 00:31:46.520
please don’t do it.

00:31:46.520 --> 00:31:50.920
Firstly, if you want to upset your mother,
you always say, "I will not have any food."

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:53.920
Finished!
The mother is finished after this.

00:31:53.920 --> 00:31:57.160
So why do you want to punish
your Mother by fasting?

00:31:58.320 --> 00:32:05.320
There is no need.
So much importance is given to food!

00:32:05.320 --> 00:32:09.960
Then do all types of things,
you get up at 4 o’clock in the morning,

00:32:09.960 --> 00:32:14.760
and go on chanting something,
and the whole house is up.

00:32:14.760 --> 00:32:17.800
Somebody might have slept
at one o’clock, two o’clock,

00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:21.400
you are doing your chandan, this, that,
and making noise.

00:32:21.400 --> 00:32:27.080
And everybody is fast asleep,
disturbing everybody.

00:32:27.920 --> 00:32:32.960
Then also the food part:
you won’t eat this, you will eat that.

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:37.800
Once we had a lady, a friend,
she’s supposed to be,

00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:42.320
who was a vegetarian.
So she said,

00:32:42.320 --> 00:32:45.560
"I’m coming to your house for 15 days
and I will stay with you.

00:32:45.560 --> 00:32:48.960
But I will not eat my food
cooked in your utensils.

00:32:48.960 --> 00:32:53.560
You’ll have to get new utensils."
So we got the new utensils.

00:32:53.560 --> 00:32:57.200
So, she said that,
"The cook has to be a Brahmin."

00:32:57.200 --> 00:32:59.520
So, I got one Brahmin for her.

00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:01.920
We all stopped eating, because, you see,
with all these things,

00:33:01.920 --> 00:33:07.000
we were going to hotels and eat there.
This lady was the only person.

00:33:07.000 --> 00:33:12.080
Then she said, "No,
I do not take this water

00:33:12.080 --> 00:33:16.480
which has come from the tap,
I’ll take it from the well."

00:33:16.480 --> 00:33:20.320
So, the well was in a far-fetched place.

00:33:20.320 --> 00:33:23.040
Every day the driver used to go
and get the water.

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:27.440
Then she said, "No, it should be brought
while you are completely drenched,"

00:33:27.440 --> 00:33:30.400
we call it oleti, completely drenched.

00:33:30.400 --> 00:33:35.440
"The driver has to be all right,
but this cook has to be

00:33:35.440 --> 00:33:40.200
completely drenched with water."
Then we said, "All right, baba.

00:33:40.200 --> 00:33:44.040
This lady is staying here for 15 days.
Let us manage."

00:33:44.040 --> 00:33:47.840
So, we sent the cook,
who was completely drenched,

00:33:47.840 --> 00:33:53.760
who had to take water
with a drenched body.

00:33:53.760 --> 00:33:59.560
And within three days he got pneumonia,
and fourth day he died.

00:33:59.560 --> 00:34:01.800
I said, "Now what is this?
This lady is going to kill

00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:09.040
how many Brahmins here on my head?"
But she could never understand!

00:34:09.040 --> 00:34:11.760
She said,
"I do the same when I am there."

00:34:11.760 --> 00:34:17.280
I said, "Baba, maybe there are facilities.
You have facilities, you should do."

00:34:17.280 --> 00:34:20.720
Like that she was torturing us
for 15 days.

00:34:20.720 --> 00:34:24.400
My children went
to one of my friend’s house.

00:34:24.400 --> 00:34:26.880
They were staying there.
From there, they were going to college

00:34:26.880 --> 00:34:31.080
and come back.
This lady would get up at 4 o’clock.

00:34:31.080 --> 00:34:33.600
I don’t know what sort of things
she used to do.

00:34:33.600 --> 00:34:36.480
She had brought all her deities,
everything.

00:34:36.480 --> 00:34:39.080
And she said, "I have to do
pujas of God, these things."

00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:50.480
And—but she had no Realisation.
Ultimately, she died of cancer.

00:34:50.480 --> 00:34:54.800
Now I told her that,
"I can treat you."

00:34:54.800 --> 00:35:00.024
She said,
"No, I cannot take water from your hand."

00:35:00.024 --> 00:35:04.680
"All right, now you don’t take water
from my hand. So how will you take it?"

00:35:04.680 --> 00:35:08.560
She said, "No, at the most,
you can blow into it,

00:35:08.560 --> 00:35:13.360
but you don’t touch it with your hand.
If you touch it, I’ll not have."

00:35:13.360 --> 00:35:17.920
So, I didn’t know how to vibrate it also,
so to begin with.

00:35:17.920 --> 00:35:22.120
And I could not give her Realisation.
I could not cure her of cancer, nothing.

00:35:22.120 --> 00:35:25.800
But she was so busy
with all this orthodoxy,

00:35:25.800 --> 00:35:29.560
so stupidly busy,
that my husband said,

00:35:29.560 --> 00:35:34.640
"I am going out to the station now
if this lady is going to stay."

00:35:34.640 --> 00:35:37.440
Now only myself and husband were left.
Everybody left, you see,

00:35:37.440 --> 00:35:40.600
my children were staying with somebody.
We said, "We don’t know

00:35:40.600 --> 00:35:43.760
how we spent these 15 days
with this great lady."

00:35:43.760 --> 00:35:50.360
And ultimately, she died of cancer.

00:35:50.360 --> 00:35:54.360
Her children were also, poor things,
they came to my house.

00:35:54.360 --> 00:35:57.440
They said, "Could we touch this?
Could we touch that?

00:35:57.440 --> 00:36:01.440
Could we touch the water?"
I said, "Were you mad? What is this?"

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:04.800
All the time asking,
"Should we go into the kitchen?"

00:36:05.920 --> 00:36:10.200
The children were really mad,
and the way they were tortured,

00:36:10.200 --> 00:36:12.320
they couldn’t even study or do anything.

00:36:12.320 --> 00:36:15.480
All the time busy,
"Should we touch this or not?

00:36:15.480 --> 00:36:19.960
Should we sit on this or not?"
With all these restrictions,

00:36:19.960 --> 00:36:22.200
what did she achieve?

00:36:33.080 --> 00:36:36.520
And there was no joy.
No joy in her life,

00:36:36.520 --> 00:36:40.880
no joy in the life of the children.
She never made anyone happy.

00:36:40.880 --> 00:36:48.200
And I was very sorry for her that doing
all this, in the name of God, where is she?

00:36:48.200 --> 00:36:54.440
So, this kind of ritualism
is also very much in the South.

00:36:54.440 --> 00:36:58.520
While in the North,
they don’t know anything.

00:36:58.520 --> 00:37:02.960
They don’t know who was Dattatreya.
But Ganesha, they know a little bit:

00:37:02.960 --> 00:37:06.960
I mean, here and there.
They don’t know Kartikeya at all.

00:37:06.960 --> 00:37:08.280
They don’t know who was Kartikeya.
If you say Murugesana,

00:37:08.280 --> 00:37:18.680
they’ll say, "Who is this Murugesan?"
They would not know. Quite abandoned!

00:37:18.680 --> 00:37:21.960
But I was surprised
when I started Sahaja Yoga,

00:37:21.960 --> 00:37:25.600
it spread like fire.
It spread like fire.

00:37:26.800 --> 00:37:31.560
With all this knowledge,
it would not work out in Madras

00:37:31.560 --> 00:37:33.920
or in Bangalore,
and I don’t know about Travancore;

00:37:33.920 --> 00:37:41.160
that’s another mad place,
where they bury their own forefathers

00:37:41.160 --> 00:37:45.840
in their own houses.

00:37:45.840 --> 00:37:49.560
Then when I went,
we had another type of people,

00:37:49.560 --> 00:37:56.600
intellectuals and communists.
And they wrote against Me saying that—

00:37:57.440 --> 00:38:02.080
I was invited by the MIDC,
these people,

00:38:02.080 --> 00:38:08.800
the tourist people had invited Me.
And in their hotel, I was addressing them.

00:38:08.800 --> 00:38:11.920
So they said, "There is a carpet,
wall-to-wall carpet."

00:38:11.920 --> 00:38:17.640
And it was not mine by any chance.
They said, "She was sitting in a sofa."

00:38:17.640 --> 00:38:22.280
That was not mine either.
All kinds of things they said about Me

00:38:22.280 --> 00:38:26.200
were so stupid!
I said, "What superficial intellectuals

00:38:26.200 --> 00:38:30.480
these are! I am going to tell them
about something so deep,

00:38:30.480 --> 00:38:35.400
and they are just judging Me
on this kind of things."

00:38:37.280 --> 00:38:47.360
Superficiality completely kills them—
they lack complete understanding

00:38:47.360 --> 00:38:53.520
about spirituality.
"It was a beautiful carpet.

00:38:53.520 --> 00:38:59.552
This was very nicely done.
And she was wearing a watch."

00:38:59.552 --> 00:39:05.400
I mean, after all, I’m a married woman.
They expect Me to dress up

00:39:05.400 --> 00:39:13.800
like a sanyasi baba. I know.
Otherwise, for intellectuals, I am zero.

00:39:13.800 --> 00:39:20.800
So on one side are the intellectuals
of the South who expect every woman

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:24.720
who thinks she has something to do
with spirituality

00:39:24.720 --> 00:39:27.520
should not wear any ornaments.
I mean, I am a married woman.

00:39:29.120 --> 00:39:33.080
She should not even wear a Mangalsutra.
She should have no relationship

00:39:33.080 --> 00:39:37.400
with her husband.
All kinds of absurd things

00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:44.920
they have made out of a lady
who has to do something in Sahaja Yoga,

00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:54.840
or you can call it spirituality.
The other side are ritualistic.

00:39:54.840 --> 00:40:01.840
I know Sahaja Yogis will be the ones
who are in the center.

00:40:01.840 --> 00:40:11.360
They have to be in the center.
And these Sahaja Yogis can see clearly

00:40:11.360 --> 00:40:17.440
that what is needed
to achieve your Realization

00:40:17.440 --> 00:40:26.720
is pure desire. Not all this nonsense.
Neither this way, nor that way.

00:40:26.720 --> 00:40:33.000
Pure desire achieves your Realization.

00:40:33.000 --> 00:40:38.280
Maharashtra is another gone case now
because suddenly,

00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:44.400
they have started drinking a lot.
That during the reign of Indira Gandhi,

00:40:44.400 --> 00:40:56.320
they were given lots of alcohol free,
I think. So now they are only drinking.

00:40:57.040 --> 00:41:06.920
We had three public meetings in Pune,
and I had seen the way they drink

00:41:06.920 --> 00:41:13.480
in front of Ganesha,
and do all kinds of dirty things,

00:41:13.480 --> 00:41:17.680
and use very abusive language.
Their women also drink,

00:41:17.680 --> 00:41:21.880
and they dance to disco
and all kinds of things.

00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:28.800
I have seen it. I was so shocked.
So I told them, "See, you are doing this

00:41:28.800 --> 00:41:34.520
in the presence of Shri Ganesha."
For fourteen days they do that.

00:41:34.520 --> 00:41:41.000
"But do you know that this deity
is such a powerful deity?

00:41:42.640 --> 00:41:48.160
And if you go on like this,
it will definitely create problems for you,

00:41:48.160 --> 00:41:53.080
and then you will be bhookampa,
means earthquakes." I told them.

00:41:53.080 --> 00:41:56.240
In three public meetings,
it is on my tape.

00:41:59.120 --> 00:42:10.520
And a fourth time, this bhookampa.
Whether you believe it or not,

00:42:10.520 --> 00:42:16.240
if you do all kinds of nonsensical things
like this, in these modern times,

00:42:16.240 --> 00:42:22.600
it will have an effect.

00:42:22.600 --> 00:42:30.480
Apart from that,
the other influences are of a-gurus.

00:42:31.680 --> 00:42:35.000
Madras is full of them.
Everybody seems to be

00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:39.480
some sort of a guru slave.
Very bad.

00:42:39.480 --> 00:42:44.520
But worse than you is Calcutta.
Everybody is dhikhit.

00:42:44.520 --> 00:42:47.440
"Dhikhit!"
Somebody sitting in the corner,

00:42:47.440 --> 00:42:53.800
there’s a guru there, "Dhikhit!"
And Tantrikas, very much more in Calcutta,

00:42:53.800 --> 00:43:05.360
of course here also you have.
When you have these bad gurus,

00:43:05.360 --> 00:43:10.000
they create such negativity
that you cannot prosper.

00:43:10.000 --> 00:43:15.308
The Laxmi Tattva goes out.
And because of that,

00:43:15.308 --> 00:43:19.197
the poverty will never go away
unless and until you get rid

00:43:19.197 --> 00:43:28.640
of all these horrible gurus.
We have everywhere,

00:43:28.640 --> 00:43:36.480
I shouldn’t say only in Madras,
or only in the South, or only in Calcutta.

00:43:36.480 --> 00:43:43.320
We have them everywhere.
But here, I think the people are too simple,

00:43:43.320 --> 00:43:46.720
and hero-worshippers.

00:43:46.720 --> 00:43:51.480
The other day, we were in Bangalore,
and there is some birthday

00:43:51.480 --> 00:43:59.680
of some cinema actor.
Thousands of them were standing on the road,

00:43:59.680 --> 00:44:02.520
sitting somewhere.
I said, "What’s the matter?"

00:44:02.520 --> 00:44:10.680
"You know, today is the birthday
of such and such cinema artist,

00:44:10.680 --> 00:44:17.865
and so they are garlanding this figure
of that man."

00:44:17.865 --> 00:44:19.480
Garlanding him,
so many were there to see!

00:44:19.480 --> 00:44:25.640
I mean, I said,
"Nowhere in the world will people do like that."

00:44:25.640 --> 00:44:32.960
This is idiotic!
It’s absolutely idiotic.

00:44:32.960 --> 00:44:42.400
You can say Americans are equally the same.
Because like that lady, Elizabeth Taylor,

00:44:42.400 --> 00:44:47.320
she got married eighth time, I think,
ninth time. Imagine!

00:44:47.320 --> 00:44:51.480
We’ll not even see
such an inauspicious face.

00:44:51.480 --> 00:44:56.440
There were 4,000 to 5,000 people,
when she was going for her honeymoon,

00:44:56.440 --> 00:45:01.100
5,000 people were there
to see her off.

00:45:01.100 --> 00:45:04.800
And she had married some carpenter
or somebody much lower than her

00:45:04.800 --> 00:45:12.240
and much younger than her.
To see her, there were at least 4,000 people.

00:45:12.240 --> 00:45:16.520
Can you imagine?
And then on top of that,

00:45:16.520 --> 00:45:23.440
there were these helicopters hovering,
who were dropping people

00:45:23.440 --> 00:45:28.320
with their cameras, you see,
to take a photograph.

00:45:28.320 --> 00:45:32.400
This is only possible in America,
even this will not be possible in Madras

00:45:32.400 --> 00:45:38.920
or even in Bangalore, I tell you.
Even if you drop off someone

00:45:38.920 --> 00:45:43.400
who is a cinema actor.

00:45:43.400 --> 00:45:49.720
This, I can’t understand.
If somebody acts like a cinema actor,

00:45:49.720 --> 00:45:56.880
say, he acts like Shri Rama,
he becomes Shri Rama even.

00:45:56.880 --> 00:46:00.600
What is happening
to the intelligence of people?

00:46:00.600 --> 00:46:04.840
He may drink, he may smoke,
he may have ten wives, doesn’t matter.

00:46:04.840 --> 00:46:10.240
He acted as Shri Rama
and Shri Rama is to be worshipped.

00:46:10.240 --> 00:46:16.680
Even in the picture or in all the cinemas,
start doing.

00:46:16.680 --> 00:46:21.400
This is going too far
with your simplicity.

00:46:21.400 --> 00:46:25.800
And it’s not only villagers who do it,
but there were all kinds of people standing.

00:46:29.360 --> 00:46:34.300
I was once in Coimbatore
and the same fellow’s car passed through.

00:46:34.300 --> 00:46:42.880
I was standing on the street.
So, they took the dust of the street,

00:46:42.880 --> 00:46:47.240
where the marks of the tires were there,
of this gentleman’s car,

00:46:47.240 --> 00:46:52.240
and put it on their heads.
I was just wondering,

00:46:52.240 --> 00:46:59.240
"What is this idiocy? My God!"
And continuous, it was.

00:46:59.240 --> 00:47:02.640
Very seriously, you know, they did.
Very seriously.

00:47:02.640 --> 00:47:06.240
They’ll shave their hair,
go near a temple,

00:47:06.240 --> 00:47:10.320
somebody will pour water on a woman,
she’s, poor thing, rolling around.

00:47:10.320 --> 00:47:15.960
Very seriously.
I feel like crying, really.

00:47:15.960 --> 00:47:22.920
How can they torture a woman like this?
All kinds of stupid things we do,

00:47:22.920 --> 00:47:25.720
and in the temple, in the name of God.

00:47:27.400 --> 00:47:31.240
I think it’s the same
as the Muslims are having Jihad,

00:47:31.240 --> 00:47:35.280
we are having Jihad against ourselves.
They are having against others.

00:47:35.280 --> 00:47:39.120
We are killing ourselves,
"Don’t eat food, do this, do that."

00:47:39.120 --> 00:47:42.960
All the time after our lives!
Are Baba, this God has created this world

00:47:42.960 --> 00:47:49.840
for your comfort, for your enjoyment.
Why did He create this world

00:47:49.840 --> 00:47:55.720
if you had to go through such Hell?
That is Sahaja Yoga.

00:47:57.880 --> 00:48:03.600
In Sahaja Yoga, you know your identity,
you understand.

00:48:03.600 --> 00:48:08.240
You understand how glorious you are.
Once you are connected to the mains,

00:48:08.240 --> 00:48:14.680
you know what powers you have,
how beautiful you are within,

00:48:14.680 --> 00:48:19.120
and you start respecting yourself.
You don’t have ego,

00:48:19.120 --> 00:48:23.000
but you have a right idea about yourself.

00:48:23.000 --> 00:48:28.360
I’m so happy, I see so many people here
from Madras,

00:48:28.360 --> 00:48:33.480
who are willing to take to Self
and who are in Sahaja Yoga.

00:48:33.480 --> 00:48:38.680
Of course, it cures people, no doubt.
It has cured many people.

00:48:38.680 --> 00:48:47.880
Apart from that, it also gives you
mental peace, complete peace.

00:48:47.880 --> 00:48:53.800
Emotionally,
you become a very balanced person.

00:48:53.800 --> 00:49:00.280
But above all, you get the powers
to give Realization to others.

00:49:00.280 --> 00:49:06.280
First, you get your Nirvichara samadhi.
And then you get your Nirvikalpa samadhi.

00:49:06.280 --> 00:49:13.400
This, you all get it,
as soon as you are connected to the mains.

00:49:13.400 --> 00:49:18.680
It’s a very, very remarkable thing.

00:49:18.680 --> 00:49:23.680
In Bangalore, I met a Sahaja Yogi there.
He told Me he is doing

00:49:23.680 --> 00:49:29.760
some sort of a tissue culture.
And normally, out of a thousand,

00:49:29.760 --> 00:49:39.760
only about 12 to 15 people get all right.
I mean, the tissue culture is where they try

00:49:39.760 --> 00:49:48.720
to create many plants out of, say,
one seed or one stem or something.

00:49:48.720 --> 00:49:55.000
"But I am a Sahaja Yogi, and I just stand
here and give vibrations.

00:49:55.000 --> 00:50:05.560
They pass through the waters,
and my success is 100 percent."

00:50:05.560 --> 00:50:10.200
He is a farmer,
he does not know even English.

00:50:10.200 --> 00:50:16.880
But he says, "Mother, with such knowledge
within myself, I can feed it."

00:50:16.880 --> 00:50:23.920
So, this is what one has to know:
that whatever you are not today,

00:50:23.920 --> 00:50:34.920
you will be by this evening.
You have to become the Spirit.

00:50:34.920 --> 00:50:43.160
This is very important to understand
that we are not ordinary human beings.

00:50:43.160 --> 00:50:49.080
First of all, you have come
to this programme because you are seekers.

00:50:49.080 --> 00:50:54.640
You are special human beings.
Then you get your Realization.

00:50:54.640 --> 00:50:59.120
You get all your powers.
You need not be a PhD, MHD,

00:50:59.120 --> 00:51:05.760
anything like that.
You need not be a big successful person.

00:51:05.760 --> 00:51:08.600
Especially, I’ve seen, those who think
they have been successful

00:51:08.600 --> 00:51:14.760
never get Realization, normally.
Because they are lost,

00:51:14.760 --> 00:51:21.360
to normal common sense, they are lost.
So they don’t get it.

00:51:21.360 --> 00:51:29.240
Like bureaucrats, very difficult!
Ministers, it’s impossible.

00:51:29.240 --> 00:51:40.040
So how do they get it?
They get it when they have from inside,

00:51:40.040 --> 00:51:50.480
innately, this desire to achieve it.

00:51:50.480 --> 00:52:01.040
Just to feel that way.
It is such a remarkable thing

00:52:01.040 --> 00:52:07.280
that everything is tangible.
Even the small children can tell you

00:52:07.280 --> 00:52:11.520
what’s wrong with you,
which chakra is bad, even small children.

00:52:11.520 --> 00:52:13.480
They close their eyes,
they will also tell you.

00:52:13.480 --> 00:52:18.560
It’s such a great discovery
which we don’t realize,

00:52:18.560 --> 00:52:24.360
maybe because we have no sense
of our spiritualities.

00:52:25.760 --> 00:52:31.440
But when I went to Russia,
the oldest university in Leningrad,

00:52:31.440 --> 00:52:38.120
which is called
the St. Petersburg University,

00:52:41.760 --> 00:52:50.480
they gave Me a big award,
that they made Me one of the ten members

00:52:50.480 --> 00:53:05.920
of the university, who were given
the topmost awards.

00:53:05.920 --> 00:53:11.360
I said, "I was one of the ten, so far.
The oldest university,

00:53:11.360 --> 00:53:16.480
I was one of the ten who got this award."
So I looked at it and I said, "What’s this?

00:53:16.480 --> 00:53:20.080
I’m just a housewife.
I’m not a scientist, nothing.

00:53:20.080 --> 00:53:26.640
How are they giving it to Me?"
And one of them is Einstein, the ten.

00:53:26.640 --> 00:53:32.040
I said, "How can you give it to Me
when you have given it to Einstein?"

00:53:32.040 --> 00:53:35.800
What they said: "Einstein,
what has he done?

00:53:35.800 --> 00:53:41.400
He has just managed the material side
and he has worked on matter.

00:53:41.400 --> 00:53:46.440
You have worked on human beings."

00:53:46.440 --> 00:53:55.160
So, things are going to work out.
And that is why I say that you should all

00:53:55.160 --> 00:54:00.920
move out from all this kind of darkness,
and get into the light.

00:54:00.920 --> 00:54:07.440
And see for yourself what you are.
First of all, to be born in this country

00:54:07.440 --> 00:54:15.600
means you have really something special.
Such a blessing it is, you have no idea.

00:54:15.600 --> 00:54:22.200
This Mother Earth, nowhere you will find
such a Mother Earth, in the whole world.

00:54:22.200 --> 00:54:30.600
But you have to have your Realisation.
Otherwise, you cannot value it.

00:54:30.600 --> 00:54:36.960
It is so great and that is why
I want you to understand that,

00:54:36.960 --> 00:54:40.560
even if you get your Realisation
today or tomorrow,

00:54:40.560 --> 00:54:47.960
or anywhere you get your Realisation,
try to understand that you are exceptionally

00:54:47.960 --> 00:54:53.680
something achieved in life,
which you could not have.

00:54:53.680 --> 00:55:01.360
It’s tangible, you can find out
on your fingertips about anyone,

00:55:01.360 --> 00:55:09.640
about yourself, about your chakras
and the chakras of others.

00:55:09.640 --> 00:55:16.720
So such a big gift is there now,
and I would request that you should

00:55:16.720 --> 00:55:25.080
utilize this gift by gifting it to others
who have not received it.

00:55:25.080 --> 00:55:29.080
That’s the greatest thing you will do
and you will be joining

00:55:29.080 --> 00:55:37.600
into a very, very big, global group,
which is the living organism of Sahaja Yoga.

00:55:37.600 --> 00:55:45.160
All over the world, you will have friends.
All over the world they will know you.

00:55:45.160 --> 00:55:47.760
There is so much I can say
about Sahaja Yoga.

00:55:47.760 --> 00:55:49.720
But in this short time,
whatever was possible,

00:55:49.720 --> 00:55:55.000
I have tried to bring to your notice
what Sahaja Yoga can do for you.

00:55:56.640 --> 00:56:05.625
Only thing is that you should attend
our programmes which they have for you,

00:56:05.625 --> 00:56:08.000
very important.
Without that, you will never grow.

00:56:08.000 --> 00:56:16.000
Like if a nail is cut, don’t grow.
It has to be grown with the help of the body.

00:56:16.000 --> 00:56:24.600
In the same way, you have to belong,
or you can say, you have to be a member,

00:56:24.600 --> 00:56:28.160
whichever you want to say.
You have to be there,

00:56:28.160 --> 00:56:32.080
otherwise, you’ll not grow.
As you know, we have no membership,

00:56:32.080 --> 00:56:36.600
we have no hierarchy,
we have no priest, nothing.

00:56:36.600 --> 00:56:45.160
We don’t believe in that, because you all
have become your own masters.

00:56:45.160 --> 00:56:56.160
Now as you are here in Sahaja Yoga,
you have to understand that all your customs,

00:56:56.160 --> 00:57:02.200
all your affiliations, anything,
is respected.

00:57:02.200 --> 00:57:04.920
Nobody will say, "Don’t do this.
Don’t do that."

00:57:04.920 --> 00:57:10.840
But you yourself will know
what is not to be done, what is to be done.

00:57:10.840 --> 00:57:13.680
You become your own master.
You become your own guru.

00:57:13.680 --> 00:57:21.160
Nobody needs to tell you anything,
because there is light in your attention.

00:57:21.160 --> 00:57:54.200
May God bless you all.

00:57:54.200 --> 00:57:58.520
Some of you are new,
I am sure there are certain questions

00:57:58.520 --> 00:58:01.840
which you would like to ask.
And here is an opportunity

00:58:01.840 --> 00:58:04.720
if you would like to ask any questions
to Shri Mataji,

00:58:04.720 --> 00:58:07.640
you are not going to get
many opportunities like this.

00:58:07.640 --> 00:58:12.400
So let us, in an orderly fashion,
if any of you want to ask any questions

00:58:12.400 --> 00:58:16.880
on Sahaja Yoga,
please stand up and ask the question.

00:58:16.880 --> 00:58:24.720
I am sure Shri Mataji will enlighten us.

00:58:42.920 --> 00:58:45.694
Louder, louder.

00:58:45.694 --> 00:58:45.720
Everybody should hear you.

00:58:45.720 --> 00:58:49.040
I have some earnest desire
to spread Sahaja Yoga,

00:58:49.040 --> 00:58:52.560
but my family problems come
and I want to know where I am.

00:58:58.240 --> 00:59:02.280
She wants to spread Sahaja Yoga
but she has family problems

00:59:02.280 --> 00:59:05.280
which prevent her
from working on something.

00:59:05.280 --> 00:59:09.680
We also have ways and methods
how to solve family problems, all right?

00:59:09.680 --> 00:59:13.760
So you can do that first.
And you can solve the family problems.

00:59:13.760 --> 00:59:24.640
What is the family problem you have?

00:59:26.520 --> 00:59:33.680
No time. She is working and has come back
after work to look after her household.

00:59:33.680 --> 00:59:37.320
That doesn’t leave her much time.
Is that what you are saying?

00:59:37.320 --> 00:59:47.800
It’s all right. Just desire it
and it will spread. It will work out.

00:59:47.800 --> 00:59:55.160
If you have desired it, it will work out.
Through meditation,

00:59:55.160 --> 01:00:12.227
you can serve yourself very much.

01:00:12.227 --> 01:00:12.268
Are you feeling cool breeze in the hands?

01:00:12.268 --> 01:00:19.560
No nothing, not feeling.
They gave me initiation.

01:00:19.560 --> 01:00:24.400
All right. That means
you are not feeling in your hands?

01:00:24.400 --> 01:00:30.120
No. No way. I am not feeling anywhere.
And I am having serious problems.

01:00:42.160 --> 01:00:45.760
Before coming to Sahaja Yoga,
you went to some guru.

01:00:45.760 --> 01:00:46.320
Yes.

01:00:46.320 --> 01:00:51.760
That’s it. It’s the guru’s prasad!
That’s it.

01:00:51.760 --> 01:00:57.400
So now, how to get rid of this guru?
That these people will tell you.

01:00:57.400 --> 01:01:02.624
Better get rid of him.
With this guru you got all this nonsense.

01:01:02.624 --> 01:01:09.240
In Sahaja Yoga, anybody who has got
Realisation cannot get this kind of leprosis.

01:01:09.240 --> 01:01:21.440
That’s it.

01:01:22.640 --> 01:01:27.320
Somewhere it must have been there.
And then it must have prospered very much,

01:01:27.320 --> 01:01:32.536
when you went down to your guru.
With that thing, the resistance goes down

01:01:32.536 --> 01:01:34.740
wherever it goes.
Even a small thing can prosper.

01:01:34.740 --> 01:01:38.200
It’s still all right, we’ll work it out.
It’s not difficult.

01:01:38.200 --> 01:01:40.800
I’ll tell you the medicine for that also.

01:01:40.800 --> 01:01:42.640
Please ask your question
from where you are.

01:01:42.640 --> 01:01:45.400
I’ll pass this on
so that you don’t have to get up.

01:01:45.400 --> 01:01:51.920
Anybody else? Your questions?

01:02:19.280 --> 01:02:24.480
In Sahaja Yoga, we can explain to you
how cancer is caused.

01:02:24.480 --> 01:02:31.920
And once you know how cancer is caused,
at least preventive action can be taken.

01:02:31.920 --> 01:02:37.040
At least preventive.
And those who are suffering from cancer,

01:02:37.040 --> 01:02:41.600
even they, if they come to Sahaja Yoga,
they can be cured. They have been cured.

01:02:41.600 --> 01:02:46.320
But they will not come. This is the thing;
this is the Last Judgment.

01:02:46.320 --> 01:02:51.920
They will not come. They’ll still go
to doctors, they’ll cut their body,

01:02:51.920 --> 01:02:58.276
cut here, cut there.
They will not come to Sahaja Yoga.

01:02:58.276 --> 01:03:01.920
And it’s a very short time, I should say,
that we have to prove

01:03:01.920 --> 01:03:08.720
that we are no less than doctors,
very short time.

01:03:08.720 --> 01:03:16.480
If they think they have it,
they should immediately come to us.

01:03:16.480 --> 01:03:20.440
But the trouble is that they have
no faith in themselves,

01:03:20.440 --> 01:03:26.040
and they have no faith in Sahaja Yoga.
They are not cursed.

01:03:26.040 --> 01:03:40.960
They are ignorant. That’s all.

01:03:40.960 --> 01:03:46.920
Some realise that there is something
in Sahaja Yoga,

01:03:46.920 --> 01:03:49.160
Christ has said
not to do any idol worship,

01:03:49.160 --> 01:03:54.280
they are not able to worship
in Sahaja Yoga. How can we take up?

01:03:56.720 --> 01:04:01.720
You see, Christ has said,
"I am the Alpha and I am the Omega."

01:04:01.720 --> 01:04:06.800
I also say, "Don’t worship idols."
Of course not.

01:04:06.800 --> 01:04:11.960
But there are swayambhus
which you should worship,

01:04:11.960 --> 01:04:14.440
which have vibrations.
Because "idols" means,

01:04:14.440 --> 01:04:18.560
anybody who is a drunkard,
who has no respect for God or anything,

01:04:18.560 --> 01:04:24.360
makes a statue and sells it to you,
has nothing to do with God.

01:04:24.360 --> 01:04:32.760
You can buy them in the market anywhere.
So every statue is not to be worshipped.

01:04:32.760 --> 01:04:37.680
That’s a fact.
But for them, there is a very beautiful

01:04:37.680 --> 01:04:51.080
solution that you can show them.
When you look at a carbon atom,

01:04:51.080 --> 01:04:55.680
because the Mooladhara
is made out of carbon atoms.

01:04:55.680 --> 01:05:05.640
If you look at the carbon atom,
towards the left, you see from the right,

01:05:05.640 --> 01:05:17.400
then you see a swastika.
Now, you move, seeing that atom,

01:05:17.400 --> 01:05:23.400
from left to the right,
then you see Omkara.

01:05:23.400 --> 01:05:30.800
But if you see from down below upwards,
you will see Alpha and Omega.

01:05:30.800 --> 01:05:35.560
Christ has said,
"I am the Alpha, I am the Omega."

01:05:35.560 --> 01:05:46.520
So now we get three forms. All right?
So whether they worship Nirakara or Sakara,

01:05:46.520 --> 01:05:54.080
there’s a proof of it
that they are all one.

01:05:54.920 --> 01:06:01.520
And that Christ himself
was Alpha and Omega.

01:06:01.520 --> 01:06:09.440
It’s a scientific proof. We got a carbon
atom made and took photographs of that.

01:06:09.440 --> 01:06:19.600
And there is a proof of it.
We’ve got a tape.

01:06:19.600 --> 01:06:21.975
I have a tape. We have a tape.

01:06:21.975 --> 01:06:21.992
Another question?

01:06:21.992 --> 01:06:40.275
What is the reason for man’s existence?
I mean, I would like to know.

01:06:40.275 --> 01:06:40.960
What is the reason for?

01:06:40.960 --> 01:06:43.200
Man’s existence. Purpose of life.

01:06:51.640 --> 01:06:54.000
Why am I there in this world?

01:07:00.080 --> 01:07:07.840
To be an instrument of God
and to enjoy His blessings.

01:07:07.840 --> 01:07:10.760
Simple as that. All right?

01:07:10.760 --> 01:07:15.147
Thank you.

01:07:15.147 --> 01:07:18.920
Sahaja Yoga, we can explain that to you.
Express it.

01:07:19.880 --> 01:07:22.920
Actually, this is personal,
but I would like to have your advice,

01:07:22.920 --> 01:07:26.560
if you don’t mind.
Can I have your advice?

01:07:26.560 --> 01:07:29.040
Before coming back to the house
to see my kids,

01:07:29.040 --> 01:07:31.640
so I allow him to see,
if there is any mistake in that?

01:07:31.640 --> 01:07:35.400
My parents, who are not Sahaja Yogis,
and my brothers all say that,

01:07:35.400 --> 01:07:39.240
"All these days, we looked after you,
why do you allow him inside the house?"

01:07:39.240 --> 01:07:42.600
So what to do, I don’t know.
But I feel that he is also an Atma,

01:07:42.600 --> 01:07:46.280
and I should forgive him.
And I see the happiness in my children

01:07:46.280 --> 01:07:53.920
when he comes.
So is there any mistake on my side?

01:07:56.280 --> 01:07:59.640
There is no mistake as such,
I mean, you are a Sahaja Yogini.

01:07:59.640 --> 01:08:05.800
But you see, somebody who is standing
in darkness, you are standing in light,

01:08:05.800 --> 01:08:09.640
and that he should understand what you see,
it’s not possible.

01:08:09.640 --> 01:08:13.680
So you should have
a very patronizing attitude about this thing.

01:08:13.680 --> 01:08:15.560
It’s all right.
Gradually they’ll all come.

01:08:15.560 --> 01:08:19.400
When they’ll see your life,
they’ll see the way you have been,

01:08:19.400 --> 01:08:27.320
definitely they’ll all come.
Have faith, because this is truth.

01:08:27.320 --> 01:08:32.040
Well, thank you.
Mother had a very tiring evening.

01:08:32.040 --> 01:08:37.040
I would like now that we break for dinner.
All of you are invited

01:08:37.040 --> 01:08:42.520
as dinner is waiting for you just behind.
So, let’s break now for dinner.

01:08:42.520 --> 01:08:46.640
And after dinner,
there is going to be singing for Shri Mataji,

01:08:47.920 --> 01:08:53.800
we’ll all enjoy in her company.
Thank you.

01:09:27.040 --> 01:11:07.040
I am going to play mandolin,
she is going to play on the violin.

01:11:07.040 --> 01:14:39.080
He is going to play on the mridangam.
Subramaniam is going to play on the ghatam.

01:14:45.640 --> 01:14:52.160
My father, taal.
Now I will start this concert

01:14:52.160 --> 01:18:51.600
with the raga Abhogi set to taal.

